('0e8d8cfa-016d-4dab-946d-6e5834f33b83', 'Breaking the Chain of Infection and Basic Practices of Infection Control', 3, '9eb9ef31-e267-486a-b9e7-210580c4b7f9', '2026-03-20 21:00:44.549'),
