('31d30d3c-df78-45a5-bf66-00205015f3cc', 'When giving a backrub, the nurse aide should…', '[\"Apply lotion to the back directly from the bottle\",\"Keep the resident covered as much as possible\",\"Leave extra lotion on the skin when completing the procedure\",\"Expect the resident to lie on his/her stomach\"]', 1, '54d5bd94-bfaa-4dbf-bc23-4eb442ca37d5'),
('31e2e7c4-e4a2-4cf0-b661-e71c75320192', 'What should a caregiver do before transferring a patient regarding their ability?', '[\"Assume the patient can move\",\"Ignore patient condition\",\"Always verify and assess the patient’s current ability\",\"Skip communication\"]', 2, '8872bf64-3d0f-46cf-a9ed-1e93223d41de'),
('3222e994-a8e2-4930-b56a-9119e82a058b', 'What is the main goal of caring for a dying person?', '[\"To cure the illness\",\"To provide comfort, dignity, and emotional support\",\"To increase medical procedures\",\"To limit family involvement\"]', 1, 'c56fa5fe-0bef-45b6-bce6-0a02d9fbd550'),
('333d17f7-e11b-4d2a-ad2c-dbc0ed32ebf2', 'To prevent equipment accidents, you should...', '[\"Use two pronged plus on all electrical devices.\",\"Follow the manufacturer\'s instructions.\",\"Wipe up spills when you have time.\",\"Use unfamiliar equipment without training.\"]', 1, '2d454161-7461-4f34-bb59-00c45483349b'),
('334ef0a8-46ca-42b3-8c29-071cea0bf557', 'When caring for a dying person, the following should be done…', '[\"Listen to the person\",\"Use touch to show care and comfort\",\"Provide privacy during spiritual moments\",\"Talk about your feelings about death\"]', 3, 'd29c9af2-8cf7-4057-8b6b-a1a0f84ba131'),
('33ec6b33-41d9-4f0d-b8d1-186030de1881', 'Why does improving professional skills help reduce stress?', '[\"It reduces work hours\",\"It eliminates responsibilities\",\"It increases workload\",\"It builds confidence and reduces uncertainty\"]', 3, '39c06649-690a-4b95-900c-d67cce948520'),
('349189ad-a0e0-43b9-bfe3-393c4ae06b67', 'The primary body which regulates and creates ethical guidelines for nursing in America is:', '[\"Nursing Association of America\",\"Nursing Federation of America (NFA)\",\"American Nursing Association (ANA)\",\"The state board of Nursing\"]', 2, '901e5737-19aa-41c8-a13a-cc963b5f734c'),
('34d6f63b-5d28-467a-97df-01da38a4d7b9', 'What is one simple way to reduce daily stress at work?', '[\"Staying disorganized\",\"Staying organized and prepared\",\"Skipping tasks\",\"Avoiding coworkers\"]', 1, '39c06649-690a-4b95-900c-d67cce948520'),
('34dc705b-2939-4542-b12b-3c320e3f9868', 'When transferring a person from a wheelchair to bed, you never:', '[\"Ask a coworker to help you.\",\"Use a transfer or gait belt.\",\"Have the person put their arms around your neck.\",\"Lock never lock the wheels on the wheelchair.\"]', 2, '2d454161-7461-4f34-bb59-00c45483349b'),
('355325c7-4ab2-44e9-b2f0-d2998576dfb6', 'What should caregivers do instead of twisting their body while lifting?', '[\"Bend forward more\",\"Move their feet and turn their whole body\",\"Hold their breath\",\"Close their eyes\"]', 1, '392fd2f4-79d8-468a-8320-1dae1ea55da0'),
('359f0f97-1cc6-4a34-afdf-d3e7d538edca', 'What is one major function of minerals in the body?', '[\"Providing immediate energy\",\"Enhancing taste of food\",\"Supporting bone formation and nerve function\",\"Replacing carbohydrates\"]', 2, '830b371f-b69f-41b9-9d04-bee30bc9ba6f'),
('35c1cdba-9037-4f35-b349-1ee9276e7d07', 'What is the first action a caregiver should take when recognizing a medical emergency?', '[\"Leave the patient\",\"Ignore the situation\",\"Recognize the emergency and act immediately\",\"Wait for another staff member\"]', 2, '397caf60-5dc5-4b5c-b4b6-48f2bd6886b3'),
('35e06c41-fe01-44c0-a28c-c6a50e6562d9', 'What are medications, such as sedatives or tranquilizers, that are used to help calm an agitated resident?', '[\"Physical restraints\",\"FDA\",\"JCAHO\",\"Chemical restraints\"]', 3, 'f11f8615-5686-41c1-a549-34a649f9c6a4'),
('365eedee-7faa-4c39-9113-e2e610b413f6', 'When providing hair care for a resident, what is the clinical significance of offering them a mirror after the task is complete?', '[\"To check if the caregiver\'s hands are clean\",\"To allow the resident to feel involved in the process and ensure their satisfaction and dignity\",\"To see if the room lighting is adequate\",\"To distract the resident from their medical treatment\"]', 1, 'e91faa50-7c0d-44f2-bd21-1eaea0a111cf'),
('36c4c33b-94f7-4701-867a-d63b3d241b89', 'Which approach is most appropriate for effective communication with a patient with cognitive impairment?', '[\"Repeating a phrase until the patient indicates understanding\",\"Asking friends and family to step out of the room to decrease distraction\",\"Using simple sentences and avoiding detailed explanations\",\"Directing communication to significant others rather than the patient\"]', 2, '272a1a4c-f70f-4684-bb1d-c80a19e881b2'),
('37941cef-1019-49da-aa9f-58d30f1cd51b', 'Why should caregivers assume a dying resident can still hear?', '[\"Hearing improves at the end of life\",\"Hearing is often the last sense to disappear\",\"Residents always respond verbally\",\"Vision replaces hearing\"]', 1, 'd4ea4a64-767a-485a-a128-e8fae6e109a4'),
('379d781c-1137-426a-8890-1374a3925ab7', 'Which of the following is the safest technique when lifting a patient?', '[\"Bend at the waist and twist\",\"Keep the patient far from your body\",\"Bend at the knees and keep your back straight\",\"Lift quickly without planning\"]', 2, '392fd2f4-79d8-468a-8320-1dae1ea55da0'),
('386e4002-db8a-402e-bb1f-890dfb3c1e90', 'Which factor can most significantly affect accuracy when measuring a patient’s weight over time?', '[\"Using different scales at different times without consistency\",\"Asking the patient questions\",\"Recording the weight immediately\",\"Cleaning the scale\"]', 0, '1fdd9048-c2e0-4125-a91e-19d9e6eb3a5f'),
('38a2c933-795b-42dc-96da-f44f553ece19', 'Which of the following best describes how cognitive impairment increases the risk of a fall?', '[\"It causes physical stiffening of the joints and ligaments\",\"It leads to side effects like increased urination at night\",\"It may cause a person to forget to use assistive devices or attempt to walk when they are not physically able\",\"It directly reduces the traction between a resident\'s shoes and the floor\"]', 2, 'aa49f47d-7374-4647-a3fc-94c3a4182c94'),
('38cced49-f464-4b9e-ad79-849b4b28706a', 'As far as patient rights go, the most important ethical obligation is:', '[\"Privacy and confidentiality\",\"Assisted suicide\",\"Euthanasia\",\"Abortion\"]', 2, '901e5737-19aa-41c8-a13a-cc963b5f734c'),
('39246b9e-abf2-47a1-ac22-e375cb61eec1', 'Which of the following would be considered a \"technical identifier\" under HIPAA protection?', '[\"A patient\'s favorite hobby\",\"The name of the city where the hospital is located\",\"The type of car a doctor drives\",\"An Internet Protocol (IP) address connected to patient records\"]', 3, '59822924-bebe-4ed4-90f2-54a28febdb0b'),
('3a0ddb73-e640-4eb4-8477-6b493e95b3f7', 'What right allows a patient to refuse medications or treatments?', '[\"Right to privacy\",\"Right to autonomy and control over their body\",\"Right to payment\",\"Right to visitation\"]', 1, 'f05a82d8-65a9-487f-a881-7c6b69520dd7'),
('3a4bd0e5-5bb6-4dfd-a9d6-4b3cdbb5c5d0', 'Which of the following diets is used for patients recovering from surgery or healing serious wounds?', '[\"Low protein diet\",\"Low sodium diet\",\"High protein diet\",\"High potassium diet\"]', 2, '067af97e-29b0-4d1a-9f2a-76bb5d68f2da'),
('3ab62ac0-c3f0-4561-a429-a1cc109d3510', 'Which of the following is a feature of severe dementia?', '[\"Ability to live independently\",\"Slight forgetfulness\",\"Loss of ability to communicate and perform basic functions\",\"Increased decision-making skills\"]', 2, 'f7cf8a63-4e75-49d5-918a-6e8dd3e566c3'),
('3add4518-37b0-47e6-aff3-5dab798921fb', 'Why should a caregiver avoid styling a bed-bound resident\'s hair in tight buns or ponytails at the back of the head?', '[\"It takes too much time to style\",\"These styles can cause discomfort or contribute to skin breakdown\",\"Most facilities have rules against braids\",\"It makes it harder for the resident to see the television\"]', 1, 'e91faa50-7c0d-44f2-bd21-1eaea0a111cf'),
('3bf88a5d-c644-4d88-807b-7a2cb28cb525', 'Which of the following is a simple action that can stop an infection by breaking a link in the chain of infection?', '[\"Reading a medical manual\",\"Increasing the room temperature\",\"Washing your hands thoroughly\",\"Using the same gloves for all patients\"]', 2, '1559396d-9733-4cad-abfe-d57610b7c738'),
('3caa17bf-ace7-48af-a594-a6fc0829b43e', 'What does the acronym PHI stand for in the context of HIPAA?', '[\"Personal Health Index\",\"Private Hospital Information\",\"Protected Health Information\",\"Public Health Institute\"]', 2, 'c20a5ab2-bfbd-4e3c-b4ee-1be19491e8e2'),
('3d3adeca-8488-4e7a-a199-aa0671996485', 'What is the most basic and effective way to break the method of transmission in the chain of infection?', '[\"Increasing the room\'s humidity\",\"Performing thorough hand hygiene\",\"Wearing a double layer of clothing\",\"Keeping all windows closed\"]', 1, 'f37a5904-1ccf-458b-a7f1-afe96646a28a'),
('3d63329b-3a9d-4201-a305-705350bfb9d1', 'How can caregivers help prevent a dying resident from feeling isolated?', '[\"Visit only when necessary\",\"Avoid entering the room\",\"Visit regularly and offer presence, even without conversation\",\"Leave the resident alone for privacy at all times\"]', 2, '370385a0-ca51-46e4-b084-cb74b5ee74b8'),
('3eb02d29-b966-4ac7-abbf-10734969ebba', 'You need to give perineal care to a female, you…', '[\"Separate the labia and clean downward from front to back.\",\"Separate the labia and clean upward from back to front.\",\"Wear gloves if there is drainage.\",\"Use the same part of the washcloth for each stroke.\"]', 0, '84f81917-156c-4b77-a41c-8e45dcb9970e'),
('3f005a05-19c4-47f6-a07d-9ac128afd081', 'What is the most common site for measuring pulse?', '[\"Carotid artery\",\"Brachial artery\",\"Radial artery\",\"Femoral artery\"]', 2, '9efcfbe0-4ab4-4f1d-8a4b-5dde1a3a3af4'),
('3f0a822e-0c74-44be-a752-554d211c6a23', 'How can dementia impact a person’s daily life in later stages?', '[\"They become more independent\",\"They only forget names occasionally\",\"They may need help with basic activities like eating and dressing\",\"They regain lost skills over time\"]', 2, '25ff77df-b870-45ce-880e-7a2276cee1be'),
('3f3c83d6-7483-4ab7-b467-e6451a793f1c', 'Dementia is best described as:', '[\"A single disease\",\"A temporary illness\",\"A syndrome caused by various brain disorders affecting memory and behavior\",\"A normal part of aging\"]', 2, '166bbd14-2963-4869-b865-e693f15b0c68'),
('3fdb9e95-3e42-47f5-980c-b35f6274f4d7', 'Which of the following is a description Fowler’s position?', '[\"Resident is sitting in a semi-sitting position (45 to 60 degrees) with head elevated\",\"Resident is lying on their abdomen\",\"Resident is lying either side\",\"Resident is lying flat on their back\"]', 0, 'd6e515cf-fa77-4a1c-b36d-6ab88db1983f'),
('3ff4ada6-032e-415b-9ea6-95cd4d119981', 'Which set of data points all qualify as identifiers that could reveal a patient\'s identity?', '[\"Room numbers, shoe size, and eye color\",\"Height, weight, and preferred meal times\",\"Fax numbers, biometric data, and admission dates\",\"Hair color, language spoken, and floor number\"]', 2, '59822924-bebe-4ed4-90f2-54a28febdb0b'),
('412f8e59-28cd-46dd-8088-1320c7a2c73e', 'What is the easiest way to ensure an accurate weight measurement?', '[\"Weighing the patient quickly\",\"Weighing the patient with shoes on\",\"Using the same scale consistently under similar conditions\",\"Estimating weight\"]', 2, '1fdd9048-c2e0-4125-a91e-19d9e6eb3a5f'),
('417623ad-fbfd-465b-bc9e-869c9de86947', 'What is Cheyne–Stokes respiration?', '[\"Constant rapid breathing\",\"A pattern of alternating deep and shallow breaths with pauses \",\"Normal breathing during sleep\",\"Breathing only through the mouth\"]', 1, 'f5393a13-0fe0-48e0-b793-6c5503390724'),
('4230014a-e47d-4a97-a0a9-6e75214c440b', 'What is an example of maintaining confidentiality?', '[\"Sharing resident information with friends\",\"Discussing details with unauthorized people\",\"Keeping resident information private and only sharing with authorized staff\",\"Posting information publicly\"]', 2, '66d3683d-f4cd-4558-90f6-e49b39476850'),
('4244ff08-6c47-4e94-b8f2-284d04b2a847', 'To prevent a person from falling, you should...', '[\"Ignore signal lights.\",\"Use throw rugs on the floor.\",\"Use grab bars in showers.\",\"None of the above.\"]', 2, '2d454161-7461-4f34-bb59-00c45483349b'),
('42ab63c8-4146-4b38-b40f-f589b3c3c997', 'Ethics are not based on government laws because:', '[\"Ethics are the same as laws\",\"All laws may not be ethical at all times\",\"Laws cover only legal requirements and have no social value\",\"Professional bodies do not agree with laws\"]', 1, '901e5737-19aa-41c8-a13a-cc963b5f734c'),
('42eb4e5e-e754-43ef-8501-d6bb44a75adc', 'Why is coordination important when multiple caregivers move a patient to a stretcher?', '[\"To make the task faster\",\"To avoid communication\",\"To ensure all caregivers move together and prevent injury or sudden shifts\",\"To reduce staff involvement\"]', 2, 'c6b12a96-0b96-4817-8611-cfce3e324573'),
('4300357a-0340-4722-91ea-2394759e43ad', 'Which method helps ensure correct resident identification?', '[\"Asking another caregiver\",\"Guessing based on room number\",\"Checking ID band and confirming name/date of birth\",\"Skipping identification if familiar\"]', 2, '59c1a68d-3138-468c-ae91-2bd9e77d34e1'),
('432ba976-55ae-4dad-8fa7-9e2902772608', 'Which of the following is the only appropriate time to have the wheels of a hospital bed unlocked?', '[\"When the patient is sleeping\",\"When the bed needs to be moved to a different location\",\"When the patient is repositioning themselves\",\"During a transfer to a wheelchair\"]', 1, '281a9307-160d-4d86-b335-ed0f83212b43'),
('44587912-89a0-4d7d-bbdd-23252fd01f1f', 'Why is it important to document the method used to measure temperature?', '[\"To increase paperwork\",\"To avoid communication\",\"Because different methods can give slightly different results and must be compared accurately\",\"To delay recording\"]', 2, 'a9481fb6-2854-4cb3-ac30-f2a006c80026'),
('445d432f-2e46-4517-a76b-9db35b61a6a3', 'What is the primary purpose of Transmission-Based Precautions?', '[\"To provide extra protection when a patient has a specific, known infection\",\"To replace the need for handwashing\",\"To allow visitors to enter rooms without any gear\",\"To reduce the cost of personal protective equipment\"]', 0, '799071aa-8ffd-44f6-9eac-13e2a56d71da'),
('44e679c1-81ef-4d8d-b9c4-90a4d58d7bea', 'What should a patient do when standing on a scale for accurate measurement?', '[\"Move around\",\"Stand still in the center of the scale\",\"Hold onto something\",\"Wear heavy clothing\"]', 1, '1fdd9048-c2e0-4125-a91e-19d9e6eb3a5f'),
('458a9a14-8229-4668-8ea0-c5032025dd44', 'Which of the following should be reported after a bed bath?', '[\"Clean skin\",\"Relaxed muscles\",\"Pressure sores or redness on the skin\",\"Warm water used\"]', 2, 'c3ddc9d7-9b76-4097-a19a-e1c8b8b729b4'),
('45c975d7-766b-467e-9eee-1a127d5ab031', 'Which method is commonly used for cooperative adults when measuring temperature?', '[\"Rectal\",\"Axillary\",\"Oral\",\"Tympanic\"]', 2, 'e3935e28-e1fd-48fd-964f-d1b5be8d3daa'),
('45cfaedf-2da8-4369-a436-2a2e20267da9', 'Why is individualized dietary planning important in healthcare settings?', '[\"All residents require the same diet\",\"It reduces food preparation time\",\"It ensures meals meet each person’s unique needs and preferences\",\"It eliminates cultural considerations\"]', 2, 'c8237a4e-a5c6-44ce-bfbf-7cb1e6093418'),
('45e39cab-5e7a-4074-b70f-bdfbbe62064f', 'Which habit supports the body in coping with stress effectively?', '[\"Skipping meals\",\"Eating unhealthy food\",\"Maintaining a balanced and healthy diet\",\"Avoiding all food\"]', 2, '39c06649-690a-4b95-900c-d67cce948520'),
('46c0e332-b54d-4b6a-a39e-834d0bfb4665', 'Why is hygiene especially important in healthcare settings?', '[\"Patients prefer clean environments\",\"It reduces staff responsibilities\",\"Patients are more vulnerable to infections due to illness or injury\",\"It improves hospital appearance\"]', 2, 'f8710db2-d98a-4e70-aac6-6620637b7333'),
('46d6d06b-4b0a-479b-800c-9c66601a2090', 'Which of the following is an appropriate way to support the family after death?', '[\"Avoid speaking to them\",\"Tell them they will feel better soon\",\"Show empathy and offer support, such as saying “I’m very sorry for your loss”\",\"Focus only on documentation\"]', 2, '5f0f2a1c-68ab-4738-a42c-0ac10b94f9fd'),
('46efc358-d2b0-4618-a646-62ea3585d7f9', 'Why should heavy clothing be removed before weighing a patient?', '[\"To improve comfort\",\"To reduce infection\",\"To prevent adding extra weight that can affect accuracy\",\"To save time\"]', 2, '1fdd9048-c2e0-4125-a91e-19d9e6eb3a5f'),
('46f027e8-c2bc-478f-b2ad-4080cc91d589', 'It is appropriate to discuss your personal or job-related stress with patients or their family members.', '[\"True\",\"False\",\"Sometimes\",\"None of the above\"]', 1, 'f1953582-5ac2-48ea-bfbf-5fc4771f5bf3'),
('46f96fdb-ad86-44e4-89a3-8dbcbb8c7a9d', 'Why are pillows used after turning a patient?', '[\"To decorate the bed\",\"To maintain alignment and provide support\",\"To restrict movement\",\"To increase pressure\"]', 1, '7507d91b-1192-4038-ba65-fd0c33af7fd4'),
('47037ff3-22cf-479c-9fbe-e1942f33d528', 'Restraints should never be used to punish or be used merely for the convenience of caregivers.', '[\"True\",\"False\",\"Sometimes\",\"None of the above\"]', 0, 'f11f8615-5686-41c1-a549-34a649f9c6a4'),
('4743c45c-21bf-4b6c-98f8-aeefb80a29c4', 'A resident’s urine appears cloudy with a strong odor. What should you do?', '[\"Ignore it if the resident feels fine\",\"Clean the bag only\",\"Report it promptly to the nurse as a possible infection sign\",\"Give the resident more water without reporting\"]', 2, '62279771-a981-49dc-9603-3e67b191fa70'),
('4776ce7e-ae32-4c51-8e51-a7078e3d9f72', 'Which patient position is most appropriate for improving breathing in patients with respiratory difficulty?', '[\"Supine position\",\"Prone position\",\"Fowler’s position with the head of the bed elevated\",\"Flat lateral position\"]', 2, '389a7d8d-2938-4604-8d2f-84f846d84e5a'),
('47e0b339-6491-4972-b0fb-79155220e50c', 'Why should the thumb not be used to measure a pulse?', '[\"It is too weak\",\"It has its own pulse which can interfere with the reading\",\"It is too large\",\"It causes pain\"]', 1, '9efcfbe0-4ab4-4f1d-8a4b-5dde1a3a3af4');
INSERT INTO `Question` (`id`, `text`, `options`, `correctAnswer`, `quizId`) VALUES
('480d3e45-a509-4e0f-9fd4-f8595ff6dc30', 'What is a potential legal consequence for a healthcare worker who intentionally misuses patient information?', '[\"A small verbal warning only\",\"A mandatory promotion\",\"Criminal charges\",\"A tax refund\"]', 2, 'c20a5ab2-bfbd-4e3c-b4ee-1be19491e8e2'),
('48407483-2a4e-479e-83c1-8a931d8e1602', 'What is a tube that is inserted into a person’s bladder to provide continuous urine drainage?', '[\"Drainage bag\",\"An indwelling catheter\",\"Ostomy bag\",\"Colostomy bag\"]', 1, '91836b42-cb09-4c0d-8071-eed39f135b57'),
('48d53834-19ab-4072-a53c-ce129ed9800a', 'What is the purpose of closing doors during a fire?', '[\"To make rooms darker\",\"To reduce noise\",\"To confine the fire and limit oxygen supply\",\"To increase airflow\"]', 2, '811051a7-2283-4853-a6c3-b9740b7fe373'),
('494148f3-476b-4a16-9fa2-ef7f562c63d3', 'Why is accurate measurement of urine output important when assisting with a urinal?', '[\"To reduce cleaning time\",\"To monitor hydration status and kidney function\",\"To make documentation easier\",\"To avoid using gloves\"]', 1, 'b91fca78-f656-4275-8725-fd09f80ef5b9'),
('4987b6fe-c5ff-40c1-a37d-f12332db455f', 'What does one complete respiration consist of?', '[\"One inhalation only\",\"One exhalation only\",\"Two inhalations\",\"One inhalation and one exhalation\"]', 3, '0a1d08c5-968b-4531-829f-b1f38f2371ee'),
('4991c149-9ba9-4ea1-903e-294ff833896f', 'It is easy to take care of residents with dementia…', '[\"True.\",\"False.\",\"Not Probably\",\"It depends\"]', 1, '208abab1-1f76-4904-bc79-331e30d79ecc'),
('49930d76-1543-4e26-bcc2-4342df9ef61c', 'Why are meals served at regular times for individuals with diabetes?', '[\"To improve appetite only\",\"To maintain stable blood glucose levels\",\"To reduce protein intake\",\"To increase sodium levels\"]', 1, '4fa74711-53a5-4985-b2e6-d5cf499b13bd'),
('49a1e868-2c59-46a1-90fa-a31b89157cbe', 'Why is it important to pay attention to non-verbal communication?', '[\"It replaces verbal communication\",\"It shows only physical actions\",\"It can reveal emotions and feelings not expressed in words\",\"It reduces communication time\"]', 2, 'd7bd6b0d-cfa9-4987-a3c2-55e8c0309dfb'),
('49a62939-a70a-4a73-b301-ed7487a9480e', 'Why should the wheelchair be placed close to the bed during transfer?', '[\"To increase difficulty\",\"To improve appearance\",\"To reduce the distance and risk during transfer\",\"To delay movement\"]', 2, 'c6b12a96-0b96-4817-8611-cfce3e324573'),
('4a5b92dc-c4a8-45c3-b7db-512494b01176', 'When a person is confused, it is helpful if you…', '[\"Repeat the date and time as often as necessary.\",\"Change the routine each day to stimulate the person.\",\"Keep the drapes pulled during the day.\",\"Give complex answers to questions.\"]', 0, '208abab1-1f76-4904-bc79-331e30d79ecc'),
('4a6605ba-5d1e-43d0-bb7d-f531b198990f', 'The purpose of infection control is to...', '[\"Increase the cost of healthcare.\",\"Reduce the spread and occurrence of infectious diseases.\",\"Eliminate the need for handwashing.\",\"Only protect the healthcare workers.\"]', 1, '3ae10c6f-51c4-4de3-ac3b-45598d7d71b1'),
('4a776a14-f6aa-4a96-8a7c-471eb68de8a1', 'How often should patients who cannot move independently be repositioned?', '[\"Once a day\",\"Every two hours\",\"Every 8 hours\",\"Only when they complain\"]', 1, '7507d91b-1192-4038-ba65-fd0c33af7fd4'),
('4b30b902-0efb-4335-8f39-681cb61beeb4', 'Which medical factor requires a caregiver to check the care plan before using a safety razor?', '[\"The resident has a history of high blood pressure\",\"The resident is taking anticoagulant medications (blood thinners)\",\"The resident prefers a specific brand of soap\",\"The resident has a common cold\"]', 1, 'b216c7dd-616d-48f7-9c6c-3113e99e4e93'),
('4c8ec87d-f161-437b-b6f4-0f32bdd61424', 'Which type of dementia is caused by reduced or blocked blood flow to the brain?', '[\"Alzheimer’s disease\",\"Lewy body dementia\",\"Vascular dementia\",\"Mixed dementia\"]', 2, '25ff77df-b870-45ce-880e-7a2276cee1be'),
('4c9843cb-2e02-4941-a723-f77b2a28d9d8', 'During bathing, a person may…', '[\"Decide what products to use\",\"Be exposed in the shower room\",\"Have visitors present without his or her permission\",\"Have no personal choice\"]', 0, '54d5bd94-bfaa-4dbf-bc23-4eb442ca37d5'),
