('4d89bb00-28cf-47f6-a270-0eaa169af2ab', 'You may share information about a person\'s care and condition to...', '[\"The staff caring for the person\",\"The family members\",\"The person\'s daughter\",\"The volunteer in the gift shop\"]', 0, '11ac83d9-baf5-43d1-a21f-17db499df927'),
