('5a06aa32-72f5-4bcc-87ab-b2cdaa5d1bde', 'What is the most appropriate action if a healthcare worker suspects abuse?', '[\"Confront the suspected abuser immediately\",\"Ignore it unless there is clear proof\",\"Report the observations to a nurse or supervisor immediately\",\"Investigate the situation independently\"]', 2, 'c94d5e14-1342-4995-951c-14928f2ff0e9'),
