('66e7c9ee-faf9-4fb7-a4d6-cffee4426905', 'To use a fire extinguisher, you…', '[\"Keep the safety pin in the extinguisher\",\"Direct the hose or nozzle at the top of the fire\",\"Squeeze the lever to start the stream of water\",\"Sweep the stream of water at the top of the fire\"]', 2, 'f11f8615-5686-41c1-a549-34a649f9c6a4'),
