('6a183435-2de4-4b37-b657-ef4a095a8405', 'Why must caregivers check the weight limit of a mechanical lift?', '[\"To save time\",\"To follow routine\",\"To prevent equipment failure and injury\",\"To reduce communication\"]', 2, '0034615a-ba32-49a4-b579-e9526110f40e'),
