('6a5349ae-2b09-4e4f-a0cc-c3680f1c5480', 'Which action best supports the emotional needs of a dying resident?', '[\"Avoid discussing feelings\",\"Limit visits from family\",\"Being present, listening, and offering comfort\",\"Focus only on physical care\"]', 2, 'd4ea4a64-767a-485a-a128-e8fae6e109a4'),
('6a7f59d1-c982-4604-9ae8-1665021cf2e7', 'How should food be described to a visually impaired resident?', '[\"By color only\",\"By guessing\",\"Using the clock method to describe placement\",\"Not describing it\"]', 2, '5a73afcd-b5f1-4498-91a6-6802c950e230'),
