('6b306f8a-37f7-41db-af0f-f5027714bcbc', 'What is an important safety step before moving a patient?', '[\"Open the windows\",\"Lock the wheels on the bed or wheelchair\",\"Turn off lights\",\"Remove pillows\"]', 1, '8a8303c4-5158-4166-a174-6b970d9d33a5'),
('6bce3ca5-725f-4ccf-a34c-8caa71f9adb2', 'Under which circumstances should a healthcare worker follow \"Standard Precautions\"?', '[\"Only when a patient is known to have a contagious virus\",\"Only when working in the emergency room\",\"For the care of all patients, regardless of their simulated or confirmed infection status\",\"Only when a supervisor is present to observe the care\"]', 2, 'f37a5904-1ccf-458b-a7f1-afe96646a28a'),
