('6c08173a-92d1-4b50-9e49-22dd326aed4f', 'What is the correct way to respond to combative behavior?', '[\"Argue with the resident\",\"Use physical force\",\"Remain calm and avoid taking it personally\",\"Ignore the behavior completely\"]', 2, 'd7bd6b0d-cfa9-4987-a3c2-55e8c0309dfb'),
