('6daf2f12-c451-4497-bbf6-24f5d544916c', 'When feeding a resident, frequent coughing can be a sign the resident is…', '[\"Choking\",\"Getting full\",\"Needs to drink more fluids\",\"Having difficulty swallowing\"]', 3, '067af97e-29b0-4d1a-9f2a-76bb5d68f2da'),
