('6fe9ea8b-132b-440f-877c-c3523f9c814a', 'What should a caregiver do when a resident expresses fears or emotions?', '[\"Ignore the conversation\",\"Give immediate personal advice\",\"Listen carefully without judgment or interruption\",\"Change the topic quickly\"]', 2, '370385a0-ca51-46e4-b084-cb74b5ee74b8'),
