('bfddba02-2e5b-4d1b-82fa-c27c4b9638e9', 'Why is weight important for medication administration?', '[\"It improves communication\",\"It reduces workload\",\"It determines correct dosage for safety and effectiveness\",\"It replaces diagnosis\"]', 2, '1fdd9048-c2e0-4125-a91e-19d9e6eb3a5f'),
