('ccb67c13-bea2-4ea9-bf76-cc38f8d09a75', 'What is one key step before starting any hygiene procedure?', '[\"Leave the patient alone\",\"Start immediately without preparation\",\"Gather all necessary supplies beforehand\",\"Remove safety equipment\"]', 2, 'f8710db2-d98a-4e70-aac6-6620637b7333'),
