('d2a490bb-6bf0-4b8b-9021-f20024aa919b', 'Why should caregivers avoid arguing with a person with dementia?', '[\"It wastes time only\",\"The person may not understand and could become more agitated\",\"It improves memory\",\"It has no effect on behavior\"]', 1, '6d4efbb4-c0de-4659-b30a-9eebb4c7c540'),
