('d3bcf4ad-82e9-411e-b9ca-8a4ef78386dc', 'What is denial as a defense mechanism?', '[\"Accepting all situations\",\"Refusing to accept a painful or upsetting reality\",\"Explaining behavior logically\",\"Returning to childlike behavior\"]', 1, 'd7bd6b0d-cfa9-4987-a3c2-55e8c0309dfb'),
